	"descriptionMarkdown": "It is designed for high capacity and does not use storage facilities for ammunition or nuclear elements. For normal operation, it requires high-quality solar panels and energy-saving modules (if everything is good with energy, acceleration modules for ammunition, especially missiles, would be necessary). But even without all that, and without endless technologies, it can fly the Fulgora-Aquillo-Fulgora-Aquillo route without stopping.\nThe central logic system controls the number of identical meteorites on the ship. The lower fuel supply to the engines is controlled by a value of 100 on the combinator, which gives 100% supply, 200 50%, 300 33%, and so on.\nThe ship flies at a speed of up to 305 kilometers.",
